{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NINA</strong> is a short, narrative-driven psychological horror game about a girl trapped in a looping version of her own mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each day, Nina wakes up in her room with no memory of what came before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> As her inner voice, you\u2019ll help Nina uncover fragments of her past, comfort her in moments of fear, and guide her through a house filled with distorted memories. But be careful\u2014say too much, and she breaks. Say too little, and she forgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Demo consists:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short duration (20-30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal Pixel art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705730?t=1746484898","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705730?t=1746484898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705730/7bddd74f9b866ca9084383a6b2f54a0b43f0f979/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746484898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705730/7bddd74f9b866ca9084383a6b2f54a0b43f0f979/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746484898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features adult objects in the background (such as lingerie) that some players may find disturbing. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NINA</strong> is a short, narrative-driven psychological horror game about a girl trapped in a looping version of her own mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each day, Nina wakes up in her room with n